    "id": "tab-filter-list",
    "status": "accepted",
    "scope": "Native Tabs + official common-table 10:2 / 4-column-span query grid with 80px right-aligned labels + configured actions; list container/spacing from common-table; business cells via slots. Existing inline configuration API retained for its consumers. No new visual constants."
